+++ b/kernel/comps/rtw88/NOTICE
@@ -0,0 +1,39 @@
+aster-rtw88 is a Rust port of parts of Linux's rtw88 driver
+(drivers/net/wireless/realtek/rtw88, Linux 6.18): the power sequences, the
+eFuse layout, the firmware download, the MAC and PHY initialization, the
+channel, TX power and coexistence code of the chips it supports, and the
+PHY, RF, AGC, power-by-rate and power-limit tables, which src/tables.rs and
+src/regs.rs hold as generated from Linux's rtw*_table.c and headers. Linux
+licenses those files as "GPL-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause"; this port takes them
+under BSD-3-Clause. The port's own code is under the MPL-2.0, like the rest
+of this kernel.
+
